  "body_html": "<p>Wrap yourself in faith and comfort with this inspiring Christian blanket. Designed as a personalized gift, it combines spiritual encouragement with cozy warmth, making it a cherished keepsake for Christian women. Customize it with a name or text to create a truly unique and meaningful item.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Easily customize with a name or text to create a one-of-a-kind faith-based gift.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Gift:</strong> An ideal present for Christian women, combining faith, love, and comfort for various occasions.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in Small (40x30 inches), Medium (50x40 inches), Large (60x50 inches), and X-Large (80x60 inches) for a perfect fit.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Inspirational Christian Design:</strong> Features uplifting messages and themes to provide daily encouragement and spiritual inspiration.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Perfect for birthdays, Christmas, Valentine's Day, New Year, or other special milestones.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Material Details:</strong> Made from soft and lightweight Polyester fabric with Polyester fill.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Maintain its beauty with simple hand washing instructions.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Chrsitian I Am Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Modern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Christian</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Letter Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Blanket Form</th>\n<td>Throw Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Small, Medium, Large, X-Large</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Size</th>\n<td>60\"L x 50\"W</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Lightweight</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Hand Wash Only</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
